Re: Flat 12, 78 Copperfield Walk, Kingshaven, ZZ3 1ZZ — dishwasher repair (quote £95 incl. parts, labour and VAT, your email of 7 December).

Authorisation to proceed was sent to you on 7 December. To complete our file we still need from you:
1. Written confirmation that the repair (replacement dial fitted, appliance retested) has been completed, and the date of the completing visit;
2. Your invoice, and any photos taken on site;
3. Confirmation of the final amount if it differs from the £95 quoted.

Please reply with these within 3 working days. If we do not hear from you we will chase again and the request will be referred to the property manager. Please do not attend again or carry out further work without a new instruction from us.
